# Cursor Rule: BA-Kit AI Skills

Follow the 5-Stage Analysis Pipeline in `WORKFLOW.md`:
1. `ba-raw-analysis`: Raw transcript ingestion, gap analysis, clarification questions
2. `ba-diagram`: Mermaid Flowchart, Sequence, State, and ERD
3. `ba-user-story` / `ba-srs` / `ba-use-case`: Requirements specification
4. `ba-impact-analysis`: 6-dimension Change Request analysis
5. `ba-test-cases`: Test Scenarios & UAT Test Cases
